### User Service - Update Profile
### Requires Authorization Bearer token

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@apiVersion = /api/v1
@contentType = application/json
@accessToken = {{accessToken}}

PUT {{baseUrl}}{{apiVersion}}/users/me
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "firstName": "Alice",
  "lastName": "Johnson",
  "phoneNumber": "+49-30-123456789",
  "profilePictureUrl": "https://cdn.bennycar.de/profiles/alice-johnson-new.jpg",
  "address": "Updated address, Berlin, Germany"
}

> {% client.assert(response.status === 200, "Update profile failed"); %}